   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Old News Broadcast**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 10 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **deadco2024-06-13** (recommended): audience recording; 21 songs; 184 min; rated 3/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer's first impression is that the audience recording sounds good, though they say they are not well placed to judge [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer says the first song after Space, Dylan's \"I'll Remember You\" from Empire Burlesque, seems never played by any associated act, even in the Dylan and the Dead shows [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **deadco2024-06-13**: taped by Sir Chu Sonoran Dawg; transferred by Sir Chu Sonoran Dawg; source: AUD: Zoom iq7>iPhone14 [1]. Also: The downloadable files stop after the last song before Drums, covering only about two-thirds of the show [2]",
